  "system": {
    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Unknown_Regions\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Unknown Regions\">Star Wars Saga Edition Unknown Regions</a></i></p><p><i>See also: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a></i></p><p>You know how to treat wounds in the wilderness, using only the natural materials around you.</p><p><b>Prerequisite:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Trained\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Trained\">Trained</a> in <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Survival\" title=\"Survival\">Survival</a>.</p><p><b>Effect:</b> Once per day, you can make a DC 20 <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Survival\" title=\"Survival\">Survival</a> check. If the check is successful, when you use the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Basic_Survival\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Basic Survival\">Basic Survival</a> application of the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Survival\" title=\"Survival\">Survival</a> skill, you are considered to have a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Medpac\" title=\"Medpac\">Medpac</a> for any <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Treat_Injury\" title=\"Treat Injury\">Treat Injury</a> checks made until the end of the day.</p><p><b>Special:</b> The Gamemaster can adjust the DC for the current environment, raising it for harsh or desert climates or lowering it for diverse locales.</p>",
